<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Our Special Dates ❤️</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Georgia,serif;
}

body{

background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe0f3,#f6e8ff,#ffffff);

padding:25px;

min-height:100vh;

}

h1{

text-align:center;

color:#d81b60;

font-size:38px;

margin-bottom:10px;

}

.subtitle{

text-align:center;

color:#7b1fa2;

font-size:18px;

margin-bottom:35px;

}

.timeline{

max-width:700px;

margin:auto;

}

.card{

background:white;

padding:20px;

border-radius:18px;

margin-bottom:18px;

box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12);

transition:.35s;

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-5px);

}

.date{

font-size:22px;

color:#e91e63;

font-weight:bold;

margin-bottom:10px;

}

.event{

font-size:20px;

color:#444;

}

.footer{

margin-top:40px;

text-align:center;

font-size:20px;

color:#6a1b9a;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<h1>📅 Our Special Dates ❤️</h1>

<p class="subtitle">

Every date here changed our story forever.

</p>

<div class="timeline">

<div class="card">

<div class="date">26 January 2024</div>

<div class="event">The day we started talking ❤️</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="date">14 February</div>

<div class="event">Every Valentine's Day we celebrate together 💖</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="date">18 May</div>

<div class="event">Your Birthday 🎂</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="date">Our First Video Call</div>

<div class="event">The day hearing your voice became my favourite feeling ❤️</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="date">Our First Date</div>

<div class="event">A day I'll never forget 🌸</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="footer">

✨ More beautiful dates are waiting for us... Forever. ✨

</div>

</body>
</html>